            %p
              Moreover, the progression exhibits
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Aufhebung"} Aufhebung
              (
              %a{:href => "geometry+of+physics+--+categories+and+toposes#Aufhebung"}> this Def.
              ,
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "geometry+of+physics+--+categories+and+toposes#TrivialAufhebung"} this Remark
            %p
              Finally, the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/rheonomy+modality"} rheonomy modality
              is
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+localization"} homotopy localization
              at
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
