              among all
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/super+formal+smooth+sets"} super formal smooth sets
              are equivalently those which are
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/local+objects"} local objects
              with respect to the following
