              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi I
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} I
              any set, then the canonical morphism out of the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coproduct"} coproduct
              (
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/disjoint+union"}> disjoint union
